{"overview":"شیدا، زن جوان ایرانی ساکن استرالیا، به همراه دختر شش‌ساله‌اش، مونا، به پناهگاه زنان پناه می‌آورد. پس از فرار از شوهرش، حسین، و درخواست طلاق، شیدا برای مونا سعی می‌کند زندگی عادی‌ای را حفظ کند. با نزدیک شدن نوروز، او می‌خواهد با آزادی‌های جدید و بدون قید و بند، شروعی تازه داشته باشد. اما وقتی قاضی حق ملاقات حسین را می‌دهد، او دوباره وارد زندگی‌شان می‌شود و شیدا از این‌که ممکن است حسین سعی کند مونا را به ایران بگیرد، می‌ترسد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Shayda, a young Iranian woman living in Australia, finds refuge in a women’s shelter with her 6-year-old daughter, Mona. Having fled her husband, Hossein, and filed for divorce, Shayda struggles to maintain normalcy for Mona. Buoyed by the approach of Nowruz, she tries to forge a fresh start with new and unfettered freedoms. But when a judge grants Hossein visitation rights, he reenters their life, stoking Shayda’s fear that he’ll attempt to take Mona back to Iran.","tagline_en":"A love letter to mothers and daughters everywhere","runtime":118,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Noora Niasari"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["AU","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"زر امیرابراهیمی","role":"Shayda","photo":"/dtrpzRUt1ZW8aFKBswArMYXaeZo.jpg","en":"Zar Amir Ebrahimi"},{"name":"Selina Zahednia","role":"Mona","photo":""},{"name":"Leah Purcell","role":"Joyce","photo":"/pZdJfok4L5MEPyzgjQZlIePtVPP.jpg"},{"name":"Jillian Nguyen","role":"Vi","photo":"/oK1INorbDKJ2ZKZf30ojMZNrMOY.jpg"},{"name":"Osamah Sami","role":"Hossein","photo":"/nH9HnMVGJbKBVBCUWAFxjiegUC5.jpg"},{"name":"Mojean Aria","role":"Farhad","photo":"/v5W5lpuAWSDVMokU0RKGkHDT2rj.jpg"},{"name":"Rina Mousavi","role":"Elly","photo":"/gl3leB3IO2e3OpeSxB5eLx0qt4L.jpg"},{"name":"Lucinda Armstrong Hall","role":"Renee","photo":"/48USiFyjt2kWSmGNiUv6fEH4lHH.jpg"},{"name":"Bev Killick","role":"Cathy","photo":""},{"name":"Jack Bonser","role":"Night Club Member (uncredited)","photo":"/5q1pxNGhDOVxiPY9nPsSFSFfJAI.jpg"},{"name":"Eve Morey","role":"Lara","photo":